              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Oku nikwo Mukama RUHANGA arikugamba naagira ati: Noogira ngu ebirwa tibiritengyeta ahabw'okuhurira okugwa kwawe, emputa ku ziritsinda, haabaho okwitwa kwingi omuriiwe? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.26.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.26.15"
            ]
          }
        },
