                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Obwo nibwo abagabe boona ab'aha nyanja bariruga aha bitebe byabo, bakajuura bushuuti zaabo, n'ebijwaro byabo eby'amabara gacwereraine; baryajwara okutetema, bashutame ahansi nibatetema buri kaanya, nibakutangaarira. ",
          "type": "text",
